# Model weights: tens of megabytes each, fetched rather than committed. Git
# history is forever, and a 29 MB binary in it is 29 MB in every clone from
# now on. `docs/migration-plan.md` (stage 10) records where they come from.
# `icons/` is this app's Vite `publicDir` (see apps/web/vite.config.ts), so
# anything served statically lives there — models included, despite the name.
icons/models/*.onnx
